      "content": "Wait, \"synergy\"? I was reading some medical journals online that said Vitamin K actually *blocks* the effects of warfarin, making it less effective at preventing clots. Won't taking a high-potency supplement like this actually increase my risk of a stroke or something serious? I thought they were supposed to work against each other.",
